BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fiddler on the Roof (1971)
DTSTART:20251225T200000Z
DTEND:20251225T232000Z
DTSTAMP:20251225T200000Z
UID:r50ZN2pH9e
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 181 mins (3h01m)\n\nSIFF Holiday Favorites Party wit
 h the best Jewish-themed musical of them all by singing along to "If I Wer
 e a Rich Man\," "Sunrise Sunset\," and "To Life". Live klezmer music by Or
 kestyr Farfeleh and free vegetarian noodle take-out from Leah's Kosher Ca
 tering. Challah will be sold by Rise Up Bakers at the screening. Doors op
 en at 11:00am\; show starts at noon. There will be a 10 minute intermissio
 n. TICKETS: $30 | $25 SIFF Member\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-eve
 nts/holiday-favorites/fiddler-on-the-roof\n\nEstimated start: 12:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Moulin Rouge!  (2001)
DTSTART:20260101T020000Z
DTEND:20260101T042500Z
DTSTAMP:20260101T020000Z
UID:TpeRBx1Dwl
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 127 mins (2h07m)\n\nSIFF Holiday Favorites Sing in t
 he new year with Baz Luhrmann's musical spectacular—complete with free b
 ling rings. The show ends in time to head over to the Space Needle and ca
 tch the New Year's fireworks while shouting "Rooooooxannnne!" at the sky.\
 n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/holiday-favorites/moulin-rouge
 -new-years-eve-sing-along\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
